{"id":570,"gn":"Pokémon Sombrenard","ft":["Il a le pouvoir de prendre l’apparence des autres. On dit qu’il se transforme souvent en petit enfant silencieux.","Il peut se transformer en humain ou en d’autres Pokémon. Il se protège du danger en dissimulant sa vraie identité.","Il prend l’apparence de son adversaire pour le désorienter et prendre la fuite grâce à la confusion causée.","Timide de nature, il change constamment d’apparence, sauf quand il est entouré de ses congénères.","Si un enfant volubile a soudain perdu sa langue, méfiez-vous ! C’est peut-être un Zorua qui a pris son apparence...","À cause de sa timidité, il aurait développé la capacité de changer son apparence.","Il lui arrive de se changer en être humain, surtout en enfant, pour venir chercher de la nourriture en ville."],"fv":{"17":0,"18":1,"23":2,"24":1,"25":2,"26":1,"29":3,"30":4,"33":5,"34":6},"gr":1,"cr":75,"hc":25,"bh":70,"eg":["Terrestre"],"gw":"medium-slow","gm":{"sv":[0,228],"la":[0,219],"swisle":[0,87],"sw":[1,87],"usum":[0,28],"usum*":[0,28,3,12],"xy":[2,124],"b2w2":[0,151],"bw":[0,76]},"f":{"570":{"n":"Zorua","t":["dark"],"s":[40,65,40,80,40,65],"h":0.7,"w":12.5,"a":[[149,0]],"av":["sv","la","swisle","sw","usum","xy","b2w2","bw"],"ls":[{"l":[[10,1],[43,1],[259,4],[468,8],[154,12],[184,16],[269,20],[282,24],[313,28],[97,32],[286,36],[539,40],[417,44],[492,48]],"m":[14,36,46,91,97,101,109,129,156,164,168,180,182,184,188,203,214,220,227,240,241,244,247,263,269,270,271,282,286,304,313,347,369,374,399,417,421,447,492,506,555,806,807,808,851],"e":[68,197,262,326,383,389]},{"l":[[10,1],[43,1],[259,4],[468,8],[154,12],[184,16],[269,20],[282,24],[313,28],[97,32],[286,36],[539,40],[417,44],[492,48]],"m":[14,91,97,129,156,164,168,173,182,184,188,203,213,214,240,241,247,253,263,269,271,279,286,304,313,340,347,369,371,372,374,399,417,447,492,496,506,514,555],"e":[68,197,262,326,383,389],"t":[806,807,808]},{"l":[[10,1],[43,1],[228,5],[313,9],[154,13],[185,17],[184,21],[269,25],[492,29],[259,33],[97,37